  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Given one or more PDB IDs, it maps each chain to UniProt, either from curated SIFTS or by automated sequence search and alignment, and outputs the result as wwPDB DBREF records with a per-chain table of identity, coverage and warnings. Data used in the run: none. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
